{
  "bodyHash": "549104211a04759d",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">《末地动物学》以惊险刺激的方式为你的世界增添了新的兴奋与危险层次！面对凶猛的新生物，如狡黠的末影迷你、致命的堕落骑士和扭曲的凋灵女巫——它们各自带来独特的混乱。探索被恐狼猎杀的积雪森林，驾驭猫头鹰的力量，凌驾于下方的危险之上。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">制作传送炸药，酿造诅咒药水，并解锁如“灵魂绑定”和“驱散”等能改变游戏规则附魔，以保护自已免受这些敌对新威胁的伤害。随着新生物、致命战利品和令人眼花缭乱的特效，你世界的每个角落都隐藏着可怕的事物——而每一次冒险都承诺着新的挑战。准备好迎接一个危险不仅注视着你……而且正在移动的世界吧。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌌 新生物</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧍&zwj;♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">末影迷你 (Enderminy)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：体型虽小但凶猛异常！这些小小的末影人拥有强大的攻击力，并且喜欢追逐 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">震荡苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">震荡苦力怕 (Concussion Creeper)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：爆炸时不会破坏方块，而是将你传送走！掉落 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷惑粉末</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，用于制作特殊的 TNT 变种。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">堕落骑士 (Fallen Knight)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：致命的亡灵战士，有时会骑着邪恶的坐骑！击败它们以获得强力的 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">狩猎弓</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐎 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">堕落坐骑 (Fallen Mount)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：由 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">堕落骑士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">骑乘的凶猛僵尸马。治愈它可以让你骑上属于自己的黑暗骏马！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧙&zwj;♀️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋灵女巫 (Wither Witch)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：邪恶的女巫，会施加凋灵效果！击败它们以用 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋落尘埃</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">酿造强力的 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衰变药水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋灵猫 (Wither Cat)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：可爱？再想想。这些凶残的猫守护着凋灵女巫，并发动快速攻击！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧟&zwj;♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">寄生僵尸 (Infested Zombie)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：末影人与僵尸的混合体，攻击时会传送你！稀有掉落一本独特的附魔书。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐺 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">恐狼 (Dire Wolf)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：雪地森林变得更加危险了！小心它们发光的红眼！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🦉 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">猫头鹰 (Owl)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：友好的森林伙伴，会攻击蜘蛛。掉落 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">猫头鹰蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，用于酿造 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">升空药水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ 新物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎇 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷惑粉末 (Confusing Powder)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：制作强大的传送主题炸药！由 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">震荡苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋落尘埃 (Withering Dust)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：酿造强力的 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衰变药水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以扭转战局！由 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋灵女巫</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">狩猎弓 (Hunting Bow)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：可附魔弓和弩的升级附魔，如快速装填和多重射击。是 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">堕落骑士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">的稀有掉落物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">末影碎片 (Ender Fragments)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：组合起来制作你自己的 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">末影珍珠</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">！由 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">末影迷你</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🥚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">猫头鹰蛋 (Owl Egg)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：酿造 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">升空药水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">并翱翔天际！由 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">猫头鹰</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掉落。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 新附魔</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📜 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灵魂绑定 (Soulbound)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：死亡后保留物品，但触发时等级可能会降低。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衰变 (Decay)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 和 🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋灵 (Withering)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：对目标施加致命的凋灵效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🚪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">驱散 (Repellent)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：当你受到攻击时，将攻击者传送离开，模仿寄生僵尸的诡计！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 新药水</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">位移 (Displacement)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：随机将实体传送远离。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🖤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衰变 (Decay)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：施加致命的凋灵效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🤯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷惑 (Confusion)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：施加反胃效果以扰乱敌人。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕊️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">升空 (Rising)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：赋予漂浮效果，让你升入空中。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/6.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客户端必需安装 &amp; 服务端必需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Puzzles Lib</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (Fabric &amp; NeoForge)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fabric API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (Fabric)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config API Port</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (Fabric)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模组支持配置，可以直接在游戏内使用模组菜单进行配置（Fabric 平台需要安装由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 制作的 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，安装 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 也是必需的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 目录下，文件名根据配置类型分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。并非所有类型的配置文件都会存在，具体取决于模组本身。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">非常感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crazypants_mc_the_second\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">CrazyPants</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-zoo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ender Zoo</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模组，我对此模组情有独钟，并非常渴望将其带回现代版本的 Minecraft 以及新一代玩家面前。几乎所有代码均为原创重写，这意味着特别是生物行为等方面将与旧模组有所不同。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特别感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 创作了所有这些令人惊叹的新纹理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/goldenagecombat/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/convenient-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/convenienteffects/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/permanent-sponges\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/permanentsponges/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ytones\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/ytones/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bartering-station\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/echo-chest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/echochest/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
